      }
    },
    "Rondo cannot open its database" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rondo 打不开它的数据文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rondo keeps everything in this one file and never sends it anywhere. Copy it, and its -wal and -shm companions, to keep a backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rondo 的全部数据都在这一个文件里，不会发送到任何地方。连同 -wal 和 -shm 一起复制即可留存备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rondo will be able to tell you before a charge lands. It cannot yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以后 Rondo 会在扣款前提醒你，目前还不能。"
          }
        }
      }
